1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,773
I woke up in the dark, and something was
breathing right over my bed.

2
00:00:05,793 --> 00:00:09,887
I looked up, and two black holes stared
back at me.

3
00:00:09,907 --> 00:00:13,314
Where its eyes should be, there was only
empty

4
00:00:13,334 --> 00:00:17,117
darkness, and it was leaking something
black.

5
00:00:17,137 --> 00:00:18,374
A blue mask.

6
00:00:18,394 --> 00:00:19,575
A black hoodie.

7
00:00:19,595 --> 00:00:21,570
No nose, and no mouth.

8
00:00:21,590 --> 00:00:25,460
And this was not the first time it had
come for me.

9
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:27,070
So what did it want?

10
00:00:27,090 --> 00:00:28,711
And where was my brother?

11
00:00:28,731 --> 00:00:30,494
Let us go back to the beginning.

12
00:00:31,094 --> 00:00:32,672
My name is Mitch.

13
00:00:32,692 --> 00:00:38,542
The bank took my family's house, so I
moved in with my brother, Edwin.

14
00:00:38,562 --> 00:00:42,996
We had not seen each other for ten years,
so we were both happy.

15
00:00:43,016 --> 00:00:46,368
For one whole week, everything was normal.

16
00:00:46,388 --> 00:00:52,017
I unpacked, and I slept, and I got used to
the quiet house.

17
00:00:52,037 --> 00:00:58,255
Then, one night at about one in the
morning, I heard rustling outside.

18
00:00:58,275 --> 00:01:01,639
I thought it was a raccoon, so I ignored
it.

19
00:01:01,659 --> 00:01:06,373
The next morning, I told Edwin about it,
and he agreed.

20
00:01:06,973 --> 00:01:10,294
The next night, I heard my window open.

21
00:01:10,314 --> 00:01:15,293
Then came a loud thump, as if something
had climbed inside.

22
00:01:15,313 --> 00:01:18,637
I sat up fast and looked around my room.

23
00:01:18,657 --> 00:01:20,286
There was nothing there.

24
00:01:20,306 --> 00:01:25,767
In the morning, Edwin dropped his coffee
cup the moment he saw me.

25
00:01:25,787 --> 00:01:30,461
He held up a mirror, and I saw a deep cut
across my cheek.

26
00:01:31,061 --> 00:01:35,578
At the hospital, the doctor said I must
have been sleepwalking.

27
00:01:35,598 --> 00:01:39,851
Then he showed me something that made my
blood run cold.

28
00:01:39,871 --> 00:01:43,271
There was a neat, stitched line on my
side.

29
00:01:43,291 --> 00:01:46,059
"You somehow lost your left kidney last
night.

30
00:01:46,079 --> 00:01:48,442
We do not know how, Mitch. I am sorry."

31
00:01:49,042 --> 00:01:51,943
The next night was my breaking point.

32
00:01:51,963 --> 00:01:55,484
Around midnight, I woke up, and I froze.

33
00:01:55,504 --> 00:01:59,534
A creature was staring down at me, face to
face.

34
00:01:59,554 --> 00:02:06,180
It wore a black hoodie and a dark blue
mask, with no nose and no mouth.

35
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:08,749
But the worst part was its eyes.

36
00:02:08,769 --> 00:02:09,903
It had none.

37
00:02:09,923 --> 00:02:15,461
There were only empty black sockets, with
a black liquid dripping out.

38
00:02:15,481 --> 00:02:19,342
I grabbed the camera from the mantel and
took a picture.

39
00:02:19,362 --> 00:02:25,991
The moment I did, it lunged at me, and
reached for my chest with its claws.

40
00:02:26,011 --> 00:02:29,701
I kicked it in the face as hard as I
could.

41
00:02:29,721 --> 00:02:33,676
Then I grabbed my wallet, because I knew I
would

42
00:02:33,696 --> 00:02:37,371
need money, and I ran out into the night.

43
00:02:37,391 --> 00:02:41,950
I ran until I reached the woods near
Edwin's house.

44
00:02:41,970 --> 00:02:45,637
Then I tripped on a rock, and everything
went black.

45
00:02:46,237 --> 00:02:50,720
I woke up in the hospital, and the same
doctor came in.

46
00:02:50,740 --> 00:02:55,274
"I have good news and bad news, Mitch. The
good news is that your injuries

47
00:02:55,294 --> 00:02:59,082
are small, and your parents are coming to
take you home."

48
00:02:59,102 --> 00:03:01,068
I sighed with relief.

49
00:03:01,088 --> 00:03:05,970
"The bad news is that your brother has
been killed by something. I am sorry."

50
00:03:06,570 --> 00:03:11,555
My parents drove me back to Edwin's house,
to collect my things.

51
00:03:11,575 --> 00:03:14,505
I was scared, but I stayed calm.

52
00:03:14,525 --> 00:03:17,756
I went into my room and took my camera.

53
00:03:17,776 --> 00:03:20,475
Then I stopped dead in the hallway.

54
00:03:20,495 --> 00:03:24,549
I saw my brother there, and I could not
look for long.

55
00:03:24,569 --> 00:03:27,182
Next to him lay something small.

56
00:03:27,202 --> 00:03:32,428
I picked it up, and I walked to my
parents' car without a word.

57
00:03:32,448 --> 00:03:38,293
Inside the car, I looked at what I was
holding, and I nearly threw up.

58
00:03:38,313 --> 00:03:41,707
It was the part of me that the creature
had

59
00:03:41,727 --> 00:03:45,412
stolen, black with that same dark liquid.

60
00:03:45,432 --> 00:03:51,712
This story is inspired by the Eyeless Jack
creepypasta, first

61
00:03:51,732 --> 00:03:57,429
posted by a user named Azelf5000, in
twenty twelve.

62
00:03:57,449 --> 00:04:00,583
Would you have stayed in that house a
second night?

